<title>ESTONIA: HANSA MAKES MOST TURNOVER ON THE BOURSE.</title>
<headline>HANSA MAKES MOST TURNOVER ON THE BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank's dealers accounted for 36 percent of the Tallinn stock exchange's total turnover in June, the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>Hoiupank's brokders accounted for 13 percent, Uhispank ten percent and Forekspank nine percent of turnover, the bourse added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
